---
import SolutionPage from '../../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
import EmailCapture from '../../../components/EmailCapture.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="Air Quality"
  parent="Mitigate"
  oneliner="Indoor air is typically more polluted than outdoor air — and you spend 90% of your time breathing it."
  slug="environment-air"
  canonicalPath="/solutions/environment/air"
  showSolutionPath={false}
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <!-- ── Why This Matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>The EPA documents indoor air as 2–5x more polluted than outdoor air in the average American home — VOCs, particulates, and mold continuously off-gas from furniture, flooring, and HVAC systems</li>
    <li>Mycotoxins from hidden mold act as direct neurotoxins — even subclinical exposure impairs cognitive function, disrupts the HPA axis, and generates chronic inflammatory load</li>
    <li>A quality HEPA + activated carbon unit in your bedroom is the single highest-ROI environmental upgrade most men haven't made — you breathe that air for 7–8 hours nightly</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Featured Products ── -->
  <h2 class="section-eliminate">Featured Products</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Protocol-matched products for your air quality protocol. Affiliate relationships disclosed below.</p>

  <div class="product-grid product-grid-2col">

    <!-- 1. 4M HVAC HEPA+Carbon Filter Set -->
    <article class="product-card" id="hvac-filter-set">
      <div class="product-badge">Recurring · High ROI</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M HVAC HEPA+Carbon Filter Set</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$29–$59 <span class="price-note">per quarterly delivery — launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Quarterly auto-ship of upgraded HVAC filters — MERV-13 + activated carbon vs. the cardboard box the builder installed.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>MERV-13 rated — captures particulates, pollen, smoke, and fine dust</li>
        <li>Activated carbon layer — adsorbs VOCs and odors the MERV rating misses</li>
        <li>Available in all standard residential sizes (16x20, 20x25, etc.)</li>
        <li>Quarterly auto-ship — the replacement actually happens on schedule</li>
        <li>Supports full home coverage at low cost per day</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">Your HVAC is running 24/7. If it's pushing air through a clogged low-MERV filter, it's distributing everything that's accumulated in your ductwork — mold spores, pet dander, fine particulates — back into every room. Upgrading and staying on schedule is the cheapest whole-home air intervention that exists.</p>
      <a href="#notify-air" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 2. 4M Bedroom Air Purifier -->
    <article class="product-card" id="bedroom-air-purifier">
      <div class="product-badge">Top Priority</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Bedroom Air Purifier</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$179–$299 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Whisper-quiet HEPA + activated carbon for your 7–8 hour recovery window — the single highest-ROI air intervention.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>True HEPA filtration — captures 99.97% of particles 0.3 microns and larger</li>
        <li>Activated carbon stage — removes VOCs, formaldehyde, and off-gassing from furniture</li>
        <li>Sized for bedrooms (150–300 sq ft) — runs on low continuously without disrupting sleep</li>
        <li>Real-time air quality indicator; auto-mode adjusts fan speed based on sensor</li>
        <li>Filter replacement subscription available separately</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">You breathe the bedroom air for roughly one-third of your life. Every inflammatory particle that bypasses filtration is another signal adding to your cumulative cognitive load. This is the first air purchase to make — before anything else.</p>
      <a href="#notify-air" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 3. 4M Whole-Home Air Purifier -->
    <article class="product-card" id="whole-home-air-purifier">
      <div class="product-badge">Insider Pick</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Whole-Home Air Purifier</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$449–$799 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Multi-room or whole-floor coverage — True HEPA + carbon for the spaces where you live and work during the day.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>Coverage: 600–1,000+ sq ft depending on configuration</li>
        <li>True HEPA + activated carbon — comprehensive particulate and VOC filtration</li>
        <li>High-output fan; multiple speed settings</li>
        <li>Suitable for open-plan living areas, home offices, and combined spaces</li>
        <li>Compatible with filter replacement subscription</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">The bedroom unit covers sleep. The whole-home unit covers the waking hours — the time you spend cooking, working, and exercising indoors. Combined, they close the coverage gap and eliminate continuous low-grade inflammatory load during both halves of the day.</p>
      <a href="#notify-air" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 4. 4M Air Quality Monitor -->
    <article class="product-card" id="air-quality-monitor">
      <div class="product-badge">Gateway: See Your Numbers</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Air Quality Monitor</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$99–$149 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">VOC + PM2.5 + CO2 + humidity — live data on exactly what you're breathing. Most people are shocked by their baseline.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>Sensors: VOCs, PM2.5 fine particulates, CO2, temperature, humidity</li>
        <li>Real-time display with historical trend graphs via companion app</li>
        <li>Alerts when any metric exceeds safe thresholds</li>
        <li>Identifies specific problem sources: cooking, candles, cleaning products, off-gassing</li>
        <li>Battery + plug-in operation — portable room-to-room assessment</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">You can't optimize what you can't measure. Members who start with the monitor invariably buy filtration within weeks — seeing a PM2.5 spike every time you cook on a gas stove or open a cleaning product is a visceral motivator that no amount of reading can replicate.</p>
      <a href="#notify-air" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 5. 4M Mold Test Kit -->
    <article class="product-card" id="mold-test-kit">
      <h3 class="product-name">4M Mold Test Kit</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$39 <span class="price-note">launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">DIY home mold assessment — petri-dish and air-sample test for pathogenic species. Know before you treat.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>Includes air samples + surface swabs for multiple rooms</li>
        <li>Lab analysis included — results in 5–7 business days</li>
        <li>Screens for common pathogenic mold species including Aspergillus and Stachybotrys</li>
        <li>Recommended for anyone with chronic brain fog, fatigue, or unexplained symptoms</li>
        <li>Pairs with a My4MLife protocol consult to interpret results (optional add-on)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">Mycotoxin exposure is among the most underdiagnosed causes of cognitive impairment in otherwise healthy men. Hidden mold in a bathroom ceiling, basement crawlspace, or HVAC ductwork can generate persistent neurotoxic load that no supplement protocol can overcome. Screen first.</p>
      <a href="#notify-air" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 6. 4M HVAC UV-C Sterilizer Add-On -->
    <article class="product-card" id="hvac-uvc-sterilizer">
      <div class="product-badge">Insider+ — Pro Install</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">4M HVAC UV-C Sterilizer Add-On</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">$279–$449 <span class="price-note">+ professional installation — launch pricing finalizing</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">In-duct UV-C germicidal lamp — continuously sterilizes airborne pathogens as air passes through your HVAC system.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>254nm germicidal UV-C lamp installed inside the HVAC duct</li>
        <li>Kills airborne bacteria, viruses, and mold spores in transit — not after they've settled</li>
        <li>Works with existing HVAC system — no structural modification required</li>
        <li>Annual bulb replacement (included in first year)</li>
        <li>Requires licensed HVAC installer — installer referral network available</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">Filtration catches particles. UV-C sterilization inactivates biological agents that survive filtration — particularly mold spores and airborne pathogens. For households with documented mold history or high occupant immune load, the UV-C layer is the completion step.</p>
      <a href="#notify-air" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

    <!-- 7. Filter Replacement Subscription -->
    <article class="product-card product-card--bundle" id="filter-subscription">
      <div class="product-badge product-badge--bundle">Recurring · Consumable</div>
      <h3 class="product-name">Filter Replacement Subscription</h3>
      <p class="product-price-range">Recurring pricing <span class="price-note">tied to your specific products — set at checkout</span></p>
      <p class="product-tagline">Auto-ship replacement filters for your bedroom purifier, whole-home unit, and HVAC system — on the schedule that keeps them performing.</p>
      <ul class="product-specs">
        <li>Bedroom purifier: HEPA + carbon replacement filters every 6–8 months</li>
        <li>Whole-home unit: HEPA + carbon replacement every 6–12 months</li>
        <li>HVAC filters: quarterly delivery in your exact size</li>
        <li>Pause, skip, or cancel anytime — no penalty</li>
        <li>10% discount vs one-time purchase pricing</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="product-why">An expired HEPA filter does not fail quietly — it begins releasing what it has captured back into your air. Subscriptions eliminate the most common single failure mode in any home air quality protocol: the filter that should have been changed three months ago.</p>
      <a href="#notify-air" class="notify-btn">Notify Me When Available →</a>
    </article>

  </div>

  <!-- ── Notify Me Capture ── -->
  <div class="notify-capture-block" id="notify-air">
    <h3 class="notify-capture-heading">Get Notified When These Launch</h3>
    <p class="notify-capture-sub">Enter your email — we'll notify you when any product on this page becomes available.</p>
    <div class="notify-checkboxes">
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="hvac-filter-set" checked> HVAC HEPA+Carbon Filter Set</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="bedroom-air-purifier" checked> Bedroom Air Purifier</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="whole-home-purifier"> Whole-Home Air Purifier</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="air-quality-monitor"> Air Quality Monitor</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="mold-test-kit"> Mold Test Kit</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="hvac-uvc-sterilizer"> HVAC UV-C Sterilizer Add-On</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="product" value="filter-subscription"> Filter Replacement Subscription</label>
    </div>
    <EmailCapture source="env-air-page" buttonLabel="Notify Me →" placeholder="your@email.com" />
  </div>

  <!-- ── Deeper Protocol ── -->
  <h2>The Deeper Protocol</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>No air filtration in the bedroom — unfiltered indoor air during your 7–8 hour recovery window</li>
    <li>HVAC filters changed less than quarterly — the system distributes whatever has accumulated</li>
    <li>Cooking without ventilation — gas stoves produce NO₂ and particulates that linger for hours</li>
    <li>Synthetic air fresheners and candles — a primary VOC source in many homes</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Fix sequence: bedroom HEPA unit first (protects your longest continuous exposure window) → HVAC filter on schedule →
    eliminate synthetic air fresheners and candles → mold test if brain fog and fatigue don't resolve.
    Source control matters as much as filtration.
  </p>

  <a href="/blog/eliminate-the-insulting-behavior-environment" class="blog-deepdive-btn">
    Read More: Full Environmental Protocol →
  </a>

  <p style="margin-top:1.5rem; font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--text-light);">
    <em>Affiliate disclosure: My4MLife may earn a commission on purchases made through product links on this page. All products are independently evaluated against the My4MLife protocol standards before inclusion.</em>
  </p>

  <!-- ── Protégé footer ── -->
  <div class="protege-card">
    Want personalized guidance on your environmental protocol? <strong>Become a Protégé free</strong> — the My4MLife App walks you through environmental optimization week by week.
    <a href="https://app.my4mlife.com" class="protege-link">Join My4MLife →</a>
  </div>
</SolutionPage>

<style>
.section-sub {
  color: var(--text-light);
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  margin: -0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
}

.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
}
.product-grid-2col {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
}
@media (min-width: 700px) {
  .product-grid-2col {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

.product-card {
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.55rem;
  transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s, transform 0.18s;
}
.product-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 22px rgba(0,184,148,0.13);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.product-card--bundle {
  border-color: rgba(0,184,148,0.4);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-soft) 80%, rgba(0,184,148,0.05) 100%);
}

.product-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent);
  background: rgba(0,184,148,0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,148,0.3);
  padding: 0.18rem 0.6rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  align-self: flex-start;
}
.product-badge--bundle {
  color: #e67e22;
  background: rgba(230,126,34,0.1);
  border-color: rgba(230,126,34,0.3);
}

.product-name {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.product-price-range {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 0;
}
.price-note {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--text-light);
}
.product-tagline {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.45;
}
.product-specs {
  margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  padding-left: 1.1rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.2rem;
}
.product-specs li {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.product-why {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin: 0 !important;
  line-height: 1.5;
  flex: 1;
}
.notify-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 0.6rem;
  padding: 0.48rem 1.2rem;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  align-self: flex-start;
  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
}
.notify-btn:hover {
  background: var(--accent-dark);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.notify-capture-block {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,184,148,0.07) 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,148,0.25);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
  margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
}
.notify-capture-heading {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
}
.notify-capture-sub {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  margin: 0 0 1rem;
}
.notify-checkboxes {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.notify-checkboxes label {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--text);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.35rem;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.notify-checkboxes input[type="checkbox"] {
  accent-color: var(--accent);
}

.blog-deepdive-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 0.75rem 0 2rem;
  padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem;
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
}
.blog-deepdive-btn:hover {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
}

.protege-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,184,148,0.06) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 1rem 0 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  align-items: center;
}
.protege-link {
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.protege-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
